###

### 3.14 Create Allocation (Assign subject to faculty)
# rate_per_hour MUST be "200" | "400" | "800"  (string)
# session_type  MUST be "Theory" | "Practical"
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/admin/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "section_id": 1,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "session_type": "Theory",
    "rate_per_hour": "400",
    "academic_year": "2024-25"
}

###

### 3.14b Create Allocation (no section_id)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/admin/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 6,
    "session_type": "Practical",
    "rate_per_hour": "200",
    "academic_year": "2024-25"
}

###

### 3.15 Get All Allocations
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/admin/allocations
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###

### 3.16 Delete Allocation
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/api/admin/allocations/{{ALLOCATION_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###

### 3.17 Seed Subjects from CSV
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/admin/seed-subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}



