# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ■  POST — MARK ATTENDANCE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4.1 Mark DAILY Attendance (full body)
# attendance_date → optional, defaults to TODAY
# hours           → optional, auto-calculated from start_time & end_time
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "section_id": 1,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "attendance_date": "2024-12-02",
    "start_time": "09:00:00",
    "end_time": "10:00:00",
    "status": "Marked",
    "remarks": "Regular lecture"
}

###

### 4.2 Mark DAILY — Today (no date needed)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "start_time": "09:00:00",
    "end_time": "10:30:00"
}

###

### 4.3 Mark DAILY — Cancelled class
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "attendance_date": "2024-12-04",
    "start_time": "11:00:00",
    "end_time": "12:00:00",
    "status": "Cancelled",
    "remarks": "Class cancelled due to holiday"
}

###

### 4.4 Mark DAILY — Using allocation_id directly (skips lookup)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "allocation_id": 4,
    "attendance_date": "2024-12-05",
    "start_time": "14:00:00",
    "end_time": "15:00:00",
    "status": "Marked"
}

###

### 4.5 Mark DAILY — Using UVFIN instead of user_id
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "VF-2024-001",
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "start_time": "09:00:00",
    "end_time": "10:00:00",
    "status": "Marked"
}

###

### 4.6 Mark WEEKLY Attendance
# week_number → auto-calculated from attendance_date (ISO week)
# month, year → auto-derived from attendance_date
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "section_id": 1,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "attendance_date": "2024-12-03",
    "start_time": "12:30:00",
    "end_time": "13:30:00",
    "status": "Marked",
    "remarks": "Week 49 lecture"
}

###

### 4.7 Mark WEEKLY — Cancelled
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/mark/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "attendance_date": "2024-12-05",
    "start_time": "14:00:00",
    "end_time": "15:00:00",
