    "status": "Present",
    "remarks": "Verified by admin — attendance confirmed"
}

###

### 4.35 Admin — Verify → Mark as Absent
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/verify/{{ATTENDANCE_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Absent",
    "remarks": "Faculty was absent, class not conducted"
}

###

### 4.36 Admin — Reset to Pending
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/api/attendance/verify/{{ATTENDANCE_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Pending"
}



