###############################################################
# ██████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
# QUICK REFERENCE — STATUS VALUES
# ██████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
#
#  Attendance status:
#    "Marked"    → faculty marked class as conducted (calendar toggle)
#    "Cancelled" → faculty marked class as cancelled (calendar toggle)
#    "Present"   → admin approved (class was conducted)
#    "Absent"    → admin rejected (class not conducted)
#    "Pending"   → not yet verified by admin
#
#  Rate per hour (ENUM string):
#    "200"  → Practical sessions
#    "400"  → Theory (standard)
#    "800"  → Theory (senior)
#
#  Session type:
#    "Theory"    → Lecture sessions
#    "Practical" → Lab/practical sessions
#
#  facultyId in GET routes:
#    Use numeric user_id  → 3
#    Use UVFIN string     → "VF-2024-001"
###############################################################
